/-!
# Direction constraints for the normalized block

The 121 non-seed coordinates are proved as real linear combinations of
original edge equations. Seven evaluations on G determine every redrawing;
seven evaluations on H also determine it. Every restriction to F is
reconstructed from six evaluations, of which four are translations.

Generated by scripts/generate_block_rigidity.py. No numerical rank or
external solver output is assumed as a mathematical premise.
-/

