  rcases hv with rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl
  · exact bundle_be976f91f8_f_reconstruction_vertex024 h H i
  · exact bundle_be976f91f8_f_reconstruction_vertex025 h H i
